@{
   
    Layout = "~/Views/Shared/_Layout.cshtml";
}

<style>
    body {
        font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    }

    .bg-welfare-left {
        background-color: #0747AE;
        padding: 15px;
    }

        .bg-welfare-left h3 {
            font-size: 21px;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #fff;
        }

        .bg-welfare-left ul li {
            margin-top: 18px;
            font-size: 17px;
            color: #fff;
        }

            .bg-welfare-left ul li a {
                color: #fff;
                text-decoration: none;
            }

                .bg-welfare-left ul li a:hover {
                    text-decoration: underline;
                }

    .content-box {
        border: 1px dashed #000;
        background: #fff;
        padding: 20px;
    }

    .welfare-font {
        font-size: 19px;
        color: #000;
        text-align: justify;
        line-height: 1.8;
    }

    hr {
        border: 1px solid #000;
    }
</style>

<!-- ================= BANNER ================= -->
<div class="row">
    <div class="col-md-12 p-0" style="margin-top:-20px;
        background:url('https://img.freepik.com/premium-photo/extensive-collection-books-library_868797-8212.jpg') center/cover fixed;">
        <div style="background:rgba(0,0,0,0.5)">
            <div class="container">
                <div class="d-flex flex-column justify-content-center" style="min-height:300px;">
                    <h3 class="display-6 text-white fw-bold">
                        CENTRAL LIBRARY
                    </h3>
                    <div class="d-inline-flex text-white">
                        <a href="/" class="text-white text-decoration-none">Home</a>
                        <i class="fa fa-angle-double-right px-2 pt-1"></i>
                        <span>CENTRAL LIBRARY</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<!-- ================= MAIN CONTENT ================= -->
<div class="container py-5">
    <div class="row">
        <style>
            .bg-welfare-left ul li {
                margin-top: 20px;
                font-size: 17px;
                line-height: 1.5;
                color: #fff;
                font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            }

            .bg-welfare-left hr {
                border-bottom: 2px solid white !important;
            }
        </style>
        <!-- LEFT SIDEBAR -->
  

        <!-- RIGHT CONTENT -->
        <div class="col-lg-12">
            <div class="content-box">

                <h2 class="fw-bold" style="color:#0747AE;">CENTRAL LIBRARY</h2>
                <hr />
                <section class="library-section">
                   

                    <p class="welfare-font">
                        The Central Library of Bharat Ratna Babasaheb Bhimrao Ambedkar Rajkiya Engineering College, Pratapgarh,
                        is the academic heart of the Institute supporting teaching, learning, and research across all engineering disciplines.
                        With a carefully curated collection of textbooks, reference works, handbooks, standards, journals, and growing
                        e-resources, the library fosters academic excellence, integrity, and lifelong learning.
                    </p>

                    <h3 class="welfare-font fw-bold" >Central Library Offers</h3>
                    <ul class="welfare-font" style="list-style-type:disc !important;">
                        <li>
                            Rich Print Collection: Core and elective course texts, competitive exam resources, project
                            reports, and reference titles in engineering, sciences, and humanities.
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            User-Centric Services: Issue/return and renewals, reference and research help, current
                            awareness displays (new arrivals, must-reads), reprography/printing, and book-bank support as per institute norms.
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            Learning Spaces: Quiet reading areas, reference corners, and staff-assisted counters that
                            ensure a supportive and orderly study environment.
                        </li>
                    </ul>

                    <h3 class="welfare-font fw-bold">Vision</h3>
                    <p  class="welfare-font">
                        To establish a dynamic and technology-driven knowledge hub that provides seamless access to global information
                        resources, fostering academic excellence, innovation, and lifelong learning among students, faculty, and
                        researchers. The Central Library envisions becoming a fully digital and interactive learning environment that
                        supports multidisciplinary education and research excellence.
                    </p>

                    <h3 class="welfare-font fw-bold">Mission</h3>
                    <p class="welfare-font">
                        To support the institute’s teaching, learning, and research endeavours by offering high-quality print and digital
                        resources, promoting information literacy and research culture, and providing a conducive, learner-centred
                        environment. The library is committed to continuous improvement through digitization, e-library development,
                        and ICT integration, ensuring timely and user-friendly access to knowledge for the entire academic community.
                    </p>

                    <h3 class="welfare-font fw-bold">Library Resources</h3>
                    <table class="table table-bordered welfare-font">
                        <thead>
                            <tr>
                                <th>Resource Type</th>
                                <th>Quantity / Description</th>
                            </tr>
                        </thead>
                        <tbody>
                            <tr>
                                <td>Books</td>
                                <td>Over 5000 volumes</td>
                            </tr>
                            <tr>
                                <td>E-Resources</td>
                                <td>Access to NPTEL, DELNET, IEEE, Springer, etc.</td>
                            </tr>
                            <tr>
                                <td>Newspapers &amp; Magazines</td>
                                <td>Daily and weekly issues</td>
                            </tr>
                        </tbody>
                    </table>

                    <h3 class="welfare-font fw-bold" >Library Services</h3>
                    <ul class="welfare-font" style="list-style-type:disc !important;">
                        <li>Circulation (Issue/Return of books)</li>
                        <li>Reference and referral service</li>
                        <li>Internet and digital access facilities</li>
                        <li>Reprography and printing services</li>
                        <li>Book bank for economically weaker students</li>
                        <li>Reading rooms for students and faculty</li>
                    </ul>

                    <h3 class="welfare-font fw-bold">Digital Transition (In Progress)</h3>
                    <ul class="welfare-font" style="list-style-type:disc !important;">
                        <li>Digitization &amp; E-Library (Under Development)</li>
                        <li>Online Public Access Catalogue (OPAC) for quick search and real-time availability</li>
                        <li>Integrated Library Management System for seamless circulation and reminders</li>
                        <li>Single-sign-on access to subscribed e-books and e-journals via institutional credentials</li>
                        <li>Remote access gateway for off-campus research needs</li>
                    </ul>

                    <p class="welfare-font">
                        Until these services go live, staff will guide users to available e-resources and interim access points.
                    </p>

                    <h3 class="welfare-font fw-bold">Library Rules &amp; Timings</h3>
                    <ul class="welfare-font" style="list-style-type:disc !important;">
                        <li>
                            Access and Timings: Opens during the working hours of the Institute.
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            Borrowing: Entitlements and loan periods follow institute rules; late returns may attract
                            fines as per regulations.
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            Etiquette: Maintain silence, keep mobile phones on silent mode, and handle materials with
                            care to preserve resources for everyone.
                        </li>
                    </ul>

                    <h3 class="welfare-font fw-bold">Library Administration</h3>
                    <p class="welfare-font">
                        Library Incharge: Dr. Alok Sanyal, MED<br>
                        Library Dy-Incharge: Ms. Pallavi Singh, CSED
                    </p>
                </section>

            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>



















